> 
> - **Uncertainty and Broader Impacts**: The quantification of health and economic benefits involves uncertainties, requiring careful consideration in policy planning. Beyond health, air pollution impacts agriculture and ecosystems, as elaborated further in the chapter.
> 
> This synthesis highlights the pressing need for coordinated global efforts combining air quality management and climate action, emphasizing their mutually reinforcing benefits in reducing health, environmental, and economic burdens.
